A||N||14||CoolBlue87GT||Speedvision Classic Roadshow idea||||1||
Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||12-27-2001||10:07 PM||||I watched a Speedvision Classic Roadshow tonight on the Fords & Chevy cars<P>Got an Idea, why not contact them & ask if they'd be interested in creating a show about the Fiero's<P>Maybe we all could send a request ???????<P>Here's their email address:<BR>info@speedvision.com<P><BR>Here's my message to them:<P>First I want to say thanks for the great programming Speedvision has produced. <P>The Classics Roadshow is the best.  Just love those. <P>I know this E-mail is one among thousands you will receive. I hope & pray somehow this gets noticed.<P>My name is Dave Lambert, I live in Punta Gorda Florida. If you need to contact me, my number in (***) ***-****  (edited out)<P>I thank you in advance for even just reading this.<P>Was wondering is anyone has considered doing a show about the Pontiac Fiero.<P>It's the only / Best mid engine production sports car ever produced by an American<BR>car company from 1984 - 1988.<P>This is not a letter trying to 'show off" my car. I'm just trying to see if you might<BR>have any interest in creating a show based on these cars.<P>There is a huge following that this car still has. We all would love to see a show<BR>made about these models. We'd love to see all years & models shown.<P>I belong to a club that is world wide, named Pennocks Fiero Forum. There are hundreds of Fiero owners that visit this fantastic web site.<P>It was created and run by a gentleman, Cliff Pennock.<P>The internet address is <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/cgi-bin/fiero/Ultimate.cgi?action=intro" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/cgi-bin/fiero/Ultimate.cgi?action=intro</A> <P>At the end of this message, I'll include a path where you can view more pic's of my car & other Fiero's at the Daytona show.<P>In March 2001, a National show was held inside the Daytona Speedway. Over 170 Fiero's<BR>were there in many different forms, Stock, modified, V8's ... on & on<P>My 87 Fiero GT w/  only 1700 miles was chosen Best of Stock, Best Stock Paint, & Best of Show !!!!!<P>(I enclosed a pic of my car here)<P>More information: <A HREF="http://communities.msn.com/SuncoastFieroClub/daytona2001.msnw" TARGET=_blank>http://communities.msn.com/SuncoastFieroClub/daytona2001.msnw</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cheever3000||12-27-2001||10:18 PM||||Excellent.  I have often wished someone with resources would make a documentary on Fiero ownership, and all the colorful groups & personalities we know and love.  This might be the closest we'll get to that.  I'll be sending my email to them soon.<BR>||||reg||14
