Z||000005||CoolBlue87GT||12-28-2001||02:54 PM||||!!!!!  Hey guy's  !!!!<P>I got a response back from Speedvision !!!<P>As follows :<P>From: Speedvision@CNS on 12/28/2001 02:05 PM<P><BR>     Thank you for your comments and suggestions. I will forward your<BR>message along to our producers. They are very interested to know what and<BR>who our viewers like, dislike and what they would like to see more of.<P>Thank you for taking the time to write us and for watching Speedvision.<P>Sincerely,<BR>Program Services,<BR>Speedvision Network<P>-------------------------------------<P>Might not hurt to have more of us send your own email messages !!<P>What do ya think ???||||reg||4
Z||000006||REDHOTT88||12-28-2001||04:42 PM||||Sounds like an "automated reply". I have that on my business site. It saves having to answer every message.<P>Doesn't mean they think Fieros are a good topic.... but maybe if they get enough of them!!!<P>------------------<BR>                                                                                                         <BR>               <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/FIREdevil.gif">     <FONT COLOR="ffoooo"> <B>1988 Formula 2.8L V6</B> 5 speed Getrag </FONT><BR>            <I><FONT SIZE="1">(Runs smooth, shifts crisp, goes fast, red and shiny all over!)</FONT></I>||||reg||1
